 'docs/development/agent-team/d09-openai-chat-structured-wire-verification.md': 'existing acceptance; inherited bounded review',
 'internal/central/model/contract/nonchat.go': 'NonchatCall/Embed/EmbeddingResult validation and InvocationID responsibility',
